    "intro_narrative": "You are a freelance operative hired by a shadow broker to infiltrate the abandoned subterranean servers of NeonCorp. The air is thick with the smell of ozone, and flickering neon lights cast long shadows across banks of dead hardware. Your primary objective is to locate and extract the highly classified contents of the Final Data Core. However, the system's architecture is deeply fragmented. You will need to carefully trace active data connections, bypass biometric vaults, and recompile scattered terminal operations to carve a path forward. One wrong move, and the automated lockdown protocols will trap you in this digital graveyard forever.",
    "narrative_style": "cyberpunk"
